  "prefLabel": "Rko 212.05 Oaths and Affirmations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rko 212.05 Oaths and Affirmations. Pursuant to RSA 541-A:33,I, the presiding officer shall administer an oath or affirmation to all persons who wish to present testimony in any hearing.\n\nSource. #13921, eff 5-20-24",
